7
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.891
all show long.

8
00:00:20.891 --> 00:00:23.509
(audience applauding)

9
00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:25.149
And the best part is

10
00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:27.770
our entire audience

11
00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:31.300
