Thank you.

14
00:00:35.653 --> 00:00:38.040
Nurses are the ultimate drew-gooders

15
00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:41.820
and that's why I am so excited to be teaming up

16
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.910
with Johnson &amp; Johnson to honor them today,

17
00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.160
that's what this show is.

18
00:00:47.509 --> 00:00:49.770
They have supported the nursing profession

19
00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.260
for 125 years.

20
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.540
Supporting the mental health and wellbeing of nurses

21
00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.850
as well as championing their impact and innovation

22
00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:02.060
in healthcare, because lifting nurses up

23
00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.720
lifts us all up,

24
00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:07.993
and today is for you and because of you.

25
00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:12.660
So, our first guest not only cares for her patients

26
00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:14.710
but for her fellow nurses.

27
00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.100
There's nothing she doesn't do,

28
00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.893
so please take a look at Tiana's story.

29
00:01:19.867 --> 00:01:23.400
(melodious music)

30
00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.270 line:15%
Hi, my name is Tiana Morano.

31
00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.600
I'm a wife and mom of two from Ronkonkoma, New York.

32
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.110
I've been a nurse for the past 12 years now.

33
00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.840
I always knew that I wanted to get into the medical field.

34
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.490
My great aunt was a nurse in World War Two

35
00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.070
and she started a first aid clinic

36
00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:40.800
on the Shinnecock Indian Reservation where my dad grew up

37
00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.000
and she inspired me to become a nurse.

38
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.180
I actually started a nursing program later in life, at 27,

39
00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.180
and I graduated at 29.

40
00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.930
I've had many jobs as a nurse,

41
00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:52.170
I started on a medical surgical unit,

42
00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.210
then I worked as a camp nurse,

43
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.400
and I worked as a school nurse taking care of kids.

44
00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.190
This year, I was board certified

45
00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:00.980
as a family nurse practitioner.

46
00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:04.270
I currently work in a subacute rehab facility.

47
00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:07.670
In 2013, I wanted to connect with other nurses

48
00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:10.890
and give us all a sounding board, so a friend and I

49
00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:14.330
created a Facebook group called Long Island Nurses.

50
00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.930
It started growing more and more, and nurses actually

51
00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:19.800
started getting recruited from the group for jobs.

52
00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.420
When the pandemic hit, I started hearing awful stories

53
00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.110
from the nurses on the page

54
00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.740
who were working on the front line.

55
00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:29.450
It was, and still is, a very hard time for us.

56
00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:33.020
I know how hard we work, how we skip breaks,

57
00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:38.020
how we work over time, so I knew that giving back to nurses,

58
00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.600
especially during a pandemic,

59
00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:41.740
was something that needed to be done,

60
00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:44.130
just to give everybody a sense of community

61
00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.830
and to keep going.

62
00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.500
I turned the group into an official nonprofit

63
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.470
so I could continue giving back.

64
00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.380
I've raised money for scholarships,

65
00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.320
I've held fundraisers for nurses

66
00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.220
and I've even put my own money in

67
00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.900
to help nurses in the group.

68
00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.200
In total, we've given away thousands of dollars

69
00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.640
to Long Island Nurses.

70
00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:03.760
We have 5,000 members right now

71
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.480
and I want to see it keep growing.

72
00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.850
I'd love to have every single nurse on Long Island in there

73
00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:09.020
if I could.

74
00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:12.000
Nurses aren't appreciated the way they should be,

75
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.280
and it means so much to be able to give back to them.

76
00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:18.540
I'm really proud of nurses and what they're doing right now

77
00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.860
despite the challenges they are up against,

78
00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:24.410
and I hope to be able to continue to support them all

79
00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.133
because we are in this together.

80
00:03:27.107 --> 00:03:27.952
(audience applauding)

81
00:03:27.952 --> 00:03:31.702
Please welcome the incredible Tiana Morano.

82
00:03:32.673 --> 00:03:35.673
(audience cheering)

83
00:03:39.263 --> 00:03:43.610
Tiana, you get to see the direct effect of what you do,

84
00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:47.790
and what is your hope for the future of Long Island Nurses?

85
00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:51.700
In your dream scenario, where does this build and go to?

86
00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.230
I just want it to expand.

87
00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.660
I want to be able to reach every single nurse

88
00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.450
on Long Island and beyond.

89
00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:01.110
Nurses deserve to be uplifted,

90
00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:03.680 line:15%
they do so much for society,

91
00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.550 line:15%
they do so much for everybody

92
00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.520 line:15%
so they deserve something in return

93
00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.250 line:15%
and that's what I try to do.

94
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.460
And you've made such an impact

95
00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:14.810
on those in the Long Island Nurses group, and guess what?

96
00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.150
We have a few of them here today to surprise you,

97
00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.913
