98
00:04:18.913 --> 00:04:22.080
(audience applauding)

99
00:04:24.532 --> 00:04:25.865
Hello, ladies.

100
00:04:26.742 --> 00:04:30.571
(audience applauding)

101
00:04:30.571 --> 00:04:33.420
All right, thank you ladies so much for being here

102
00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:36.810
to support Tiana and promote the Long Island Nurses.

103
00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:38.500
May I ask Holly

104
00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:42.620
how it has been to be a part of Tiana's group?

105
00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.120
How did it impact you?

106
00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.830 line:15%
So, I am a very proud school nurse on Long Island

107
00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.180 line:15%
and I came to find the group

108
00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.920 line:15%
right when the pandemic started

109
00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.520 line:15%
because I knew we were going to turn into a virtual format

110
00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.930
and I wanted to figure out a way that I could contribute

111
00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.580
when schools went virtual.

112
00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:03.240
And within four days I was on the lines, doing swabbing

113
00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.400
on the drive-throughs across Long Island,

114
00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.100
and it made me so fulfilled, and not only that opportunity,

115
00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.730
but then I kept networking with other members in the group

116
00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.500
and I secured another position,

117
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.740
and I do telemedicine still to this day.

118
00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:18.650
And the groups just so much offers a safe space

119
00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.590
for professionals to come together,

120
00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.630
and I just hope that you realize

121
00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.040
the impact that you've made for me,

122
00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.130
the impact that you've made for nurses on Long Island

123
00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.860
far and wide, so thank you.

124
00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.740
(audience applauding)

125
00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.110
(audience cheering)

126
00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.140
Well, thank you.

127
00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:38.590
Holly, I really appreciate that sentiment.

128
00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:42.580
That's the part of that motivation, you know?

129
00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.350
How does that make you feel?

130
00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.710
Well, it really touches my heart.

131
00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:50.530
I mean, just to see people

132
00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.120
that I'm actually affecting, nurses,

133
00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.810
so it just really-

134
00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:55.743
It completes me.

135
00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.970
